{"3759650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cards of the Abyss", "steam_appid": 3759650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4954840], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/1c714530087fc35fd115671d346d5af7.avif?t=1784540261\" alt=\"Cards of the Abyss\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras_big/1c714530087fc35fd115671d346d5af7.webp?t=1784540261 width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Somewhere between Slay the Spire and Into the Breach</i></strong><i>, Cards of the Abyss is a <strong>roguelike tactical deckbuilder</strong> set in the heart of an ancient Abyss.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken in the depths of a forgotten world and <strong>descend ever deeper into the Abyss</strong> - a gigantic chasm carved out by a vanished civilization. Control a lone hero on a battle grid, <strong>dodge enemy attacks</strong> and <strong>chain card combos</strong> to survive... and reveal <strong>the secrets of a petrified past</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/a43ede925410c6883fcddc7eb44cbd85.avif?t=1784540261\" alt=\"A Movement Based Deckbuilder\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras_big/a43ede925410c6883fcddc7eb44cbd85.webp?t=1784540261 width=1560 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/d9736e9ce68c3cf9361dc44cf2cec2c6.poster.avif?t=1784540261\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/d9736e9ce68c3cf9361dc44cf2cec2c6.webm?t=1784540261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/d9736e9ce68c3cf9361dc44cf2cec2c6.mp4?t=1784540261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cards of the Abyss, <strong>cards control your movement as well as your attacks</strong>. Positioning, anticipation and sequencing are essential to triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies reveal their intentions in advance</strong>: it's up to you to adapt your strategy to avoid attacks, interact with objects on the ground, <strong>exploit opposing Tactical Zones triggered by movement</strong>... and <strong>unleash devastating combos</strong> at just the right moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/ec2e1f85289ed7da99098ac4ce2e7aca.avif?t=1784540261\" alt=\"A Procedural Abyss\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras_big/ec2e1f85289ed7da99098ac4ce2e7aca.webp?t=1784540261 width=1560 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/f033b8473cb155d658c6eaa7090c2a2f.poster.avif?t=1784540261\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/f033b8473cb155d658c6eaa7090c2a2f.webm?t=1784540261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/f033b8473cb155d658c6eaa7090c2a2f.mp4?t=1784540261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is divided into <strong>three acts</strong>, each with its own enemies, bosses, events and rewards. Each act is made up of procedurally generated nodes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elite</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasures</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events with multiple choices</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campfires</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course... a Boss!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special <strong>Mini-Biomes</strong> may appear, bringing unique modifiers to the environment: burning terrain, gold mines, plant invasions... as well as much more tempting rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/05f28c9f32491192e68f265668062cec.avif?t=1784540261\" alt=\"Build, Adapt, Master\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras_big/05f28c9f32491192e68f265668062cec.webp?t=1784540261 width=1560 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose from hundreds of cards</strong>, <strong>upgrade them</strong>, and evolve your deck as you fight. Find powerful synergies, <strong>unlock relics</strong> with profound effects, and experiment with multiple approaches for every situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each playable character is different</strong>, offering a unique playing style and card pool. And through your runs, <strong>a persistent main quest</strong> will unlock new options, bonuses and mechanics over the long haul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All the cards in the game feature an integrated GIF animation</strong>, which is triggered on hovering to visually illustrate their effect - making even the most obscure effects crystal clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/e53aa5cd47ca9d3a33a26a8d27227335.poster.avif?t=1784540261\" aria-label=\"Gif of the gif embedded in every cards\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/e53aa5cd47ca9d3a33a26a8d27227335.webm?t=1784540261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/e53aa5cd47ca9d3a33a26a8d27227335.mp4?t=1784540261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/e5807d450177db29111cc155f7bc43a2.avif?t=1784540261\" alt=\"A Civilization Frozen In Mana\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras_big/e5807d450177db29111cc155f7bc43a2.webp?t=1784540261 width=1560 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Abyss was once a refuge built by <strong>the Ancients</strong> to survive the Eruption. But their hope of one day awakening was shattered when the Clepsydra, the source of resurrection, was destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since then, their people have been frozen, <strong>Crystallised forever</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today, new creatures, altered by the magical energy of the place, haunt the depths. Guided by the telepathic voice of Nyssara, <strong>an ancestral dragon</strong>, you are the only one who can descend to the bottom of the abyss... and perhaps <strong>rekindle the Clepsydra</strong>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/1c714530087fc35fd115671d346d5af7.avif?t=1784540261\" alt=\"Cards of the Abyss\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras_big/1c714530087fc35fd115671d346d5af7.webp?t=1784540261 width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Somewhere between Slay the Spire and Into the Breach</i></strong><i>, Cards of the Abyss is a <strong>roguelike tactical deckbuilder</strong> set in the heart of an ancient Abyss.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken in the depths of a forgotten world and <strong>descend ever deeper into the Abyss</strong> - a gigantic chasm carved out by a vanished civilization. Control a lone hero on a battle grid, <strong>dodge enemy attacks</strong> and <strong>chain card combos</strong> to survive... and reveal <strong>the secrets of a petrified past</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/a43ede925410c6883fcddc7eb44cbd85.avif?t=1784540261\" alt=\"A Movement Based Deckbuilder\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras_big/a43ede925410c6883fcddc7eb44cbd85.webp?t=1784540261 width=1560 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/d9736e9ce68c3cf9361dc44cf2cec2c6.poster.avif?t=1784540261\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/d9736e9ce68c3cf9361dc44cf2cec2c6.webm?t=1784540261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/d9736e9ce68c3cf9361dc44cf2cec2c6.mp4?t=1784540261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cards of the Abyss, <strong>cards control your movement as well as your attacks</strong>. Positioning, anticipation and sequencing are essential to triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies reveal their intentions in advance</strong>: it's up to you to adapt your strategy to avoid attacks, interact with objects on the ground, <strong>exploit opposing Tactical Zones triggered by movement</strong>... and <strong>unleash devastating combos</strong> at just the right moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/ec2e1f85289ed7da99098ac4ce2e7aca.avif?t=1784540261\" alt=\"A Procedural Abyss\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras_big/ec2e1f85289ed7da99098ac4ce2e7aca.webp?t=1784540261 width=1560 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/f033b8473cb155d658c6eaa7090c2a2f.poster.avif?t=1784540261\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/f033b8473cb155d658c6eaa7090c2a2f.webm?t=1784540261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/f033b8473cb155d658c6eaa7090c2a2f.mp4?t=1784540261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is divided into <strong>three acts</strong>, each with its own enemies, bosses, events and rewards. Each act is made up of procedurally generated nodes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elite</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasures</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events with multiple choices</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campfires</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course... a Boss!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special <strong>Mini-Biomes</strong> may appear, bringing unique modifiers to the environment: burning terrain, gold mines, plant invasions... as well as much more tempting rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/05f28c9f32491192e68f265668062cec.avif?t=1784540261\" alt=\"Build, Adapt, Master\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras_big/05f28c9f32491192e68f265668062cec.webp?t=1784540261 width=1560 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose from hundreds of cards</strong>, <strong>upgrade them</strong>, and evolve your deck as you fight. Find powerful synergies, <strong>unlock relics</strong> with profound effects, and experiment with multiple approaches for every situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each playable character is different</strong>, offering a unique playing style and card pool. And through your runs, <strong>a persistent main quest</strong> will unlock new options, bonuses and mechanics over the long haul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All the cards in the game feature an integrated GIF animation</strong>, which is triggered on hovering to visually illustrate their effect - making even the most obscure effects crystal clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/e53aa5cd47ca9d3a33a26a8d27227335.poster.avif?t=1784540261\" aria-label=\"Gif of the gif embedded in every cards\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/e53aa5cd47ca9d3a33a26a8d27227335.webm?t=1784540261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/e53aa5cd47ca9d3a33a26a8d27227335.mp4?t=1784540261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras/e5807d450177db29111cc155f7bc43a2.avif?t=1784540261\" alt=\"A Civilization Frozen In Mana\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759650/extras_big/e5807d450177db29111cc155f7bc43a2.webp?t=1784540261 width=1560 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Abyss was once a refuge built by <strong>the Ancients</strong> to survive the Eruption. But their hope of one day awakening was shattered when the Clepsydra, the source of resurrection, was destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since then, their people have been frozen, <strong>Crystallised forever</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today, new creatures, altered by the magical energy of the place, haunt the depths. Guided by the telepathic voice of Nyssara, <strong>an ancestral dragon</strong>, you are the only one who can descend to the bottom of the abyss... and perhaps <strong>rekindle the Clepsydra</strong>.</p>", "s